{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方的大号白字主句，金色强调的“憋着气”“当作自己人”尤其醒目；随后中部第二块两行大号标题也会争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他还憋着气，想起曾经被当作自己人，短暂地高兴了一会儿。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"余怒未消，夹杂着短暂的高兴。\",\n  \"missed\": \"高兴尚未完全消退就转为心酸，以及对过去无法挽回、离开后是否真的更好的怀疑。暂时轻松但心事仍无答案的进一步变化也不容易第一眼获得。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样醒目的大号标题争夺主视线\",\n    \"核心情绪变化分散在上下两块主标题里，需要拼接\",\n    \"下方主标题较长，包含情绪转折、过去无法挽回和对离开的追问，单块有多层意思\",\n    \"小字连续堆叠，需要在多条补充信息之间挑选\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a96586cc-5f11-4d90-b971-91d4a9ad322c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T022514614757Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:25:55.113668+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2c575b77408d5d68e036f6f19bbcbf2bd93de27eb2d581b85fbd547054ce31bd", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683"